
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Midnight Dreams</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background: #100d1c;
            color: #f3e8ff;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #c4a1ff;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        p {
            color: #d8cde8;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        button {
            background: #a879e8;
            color: #100d1c;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>☾ Midnight Dreams ✨</h1>

    <p>A little corner of the universe, made by me.</p>

    <p>Dream quietly. Build boldly.</p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">Click for a surprise</button>

    <p id="message"></p>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("message").textContent =
                "You are creating something wonderful! 🌙";
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
